00:37:45.329 --> 00:37:46.318
Shh, shh.


00:37:46.430 --> 00:37:49.456
They're after me.


00:37:49.567 --> 00:37:51.626
I'm not crazy.
I'm not crazy.


00:37:51.736 --> 00:37:53.431
You hear them, don't you?


00:37:53.537 --> 00:37:56.506
[tape whirring]


00:37:56.607 --> 00:37:58.575
You hear them, don't you?


