00:54:10.680 --> 00:54:13.114
- [crying]


00:54:13.216 --> 00:54:14.945
- Hug me once, okay?


00:54:15.051 --> 00:54:18.043
- Open the goddamn door!


00:54:26.029 --> 00:54:27.121
- Domestic officers arrived.


00:54:27.230 --> 00:54:28.254
- 1026?


00:54:28.365 --> 00:54:31.095
- Yeah, right down here.


00:54:31.201 --> 00:54:32.725
- You know the tenants?


00:54:32.836 --> 00:54:34.736
- No.
They fight a lot.


00:54:34.838 --> 00:54:36.772
It got pretty bad tonight.


00:54:36.873 --> 00:54:38.568
- You see anything?


00:54:38.675 --> 00:54:40.233
No, but there's a-
there's a little girl,


00:54:40.343 --> 00:54:43.642
and I didn't want
to take chances.


00:54:43.747 --> 00:54:44.736
The guy is a cop.


00:54:47.217 --> 00:54:49.913
- Please stand back, sir.


00:54:50.020 --> 00:54:51.453
[knocking at door]


00:54:51.554 --> 00:54:52.543
NYPD.


00:54:52.656 --> 00:54:57.355
Anybody inside in need
of assistance?


00:54:57.460 --> 00:54:59.018
[knocking at door]


00:54:59.129 --> 00:55:01.359
Open up!


00:55:01.464 --> 00:55:03.898
- Roger that.


00:55:04.000 --> 00:55:06.992
[door creaks]


00:55:12.175 --> 00:55:15.611
What is this, a joke?


00:55:15.712 --> 00:55:17.179
- Where are they?


00:55:17.280 --> 00:55:18.770
- Are you sure this is
the apartment?


00:55:20.617 --> 00:55:22.642
- Yeah.
Yeah.


00:55:22.752 --> 00:55:24.344
I-I just heard them.


00:55:24.454 --> 00:55:27.287
- It doesn't look like anyone's
lived here in a very long time.


00:55:30.393 --> 00:55:31.382
You been drinking tonight?


00:55:31.494 --> 00:55:34.327
- No.
No!


00:55:34.431 --> 00:55:36.126
The daughter was just
at my apartment.


00:55:36.232 --> 00:55:38.700
- What's her name?


00:55:38.802 --> 00:55:40.167
- l-I don't know.


00:55:40.270 --> 00:55:41.635
And the wife,
the one that was beaten,


00:55:41.738 --> 00:55:44.400
do you know her name?


00:55:44.507 --> 00:55:45.565
- She never told me.


00:55:45.675 --> 00:55:47.734
- Most people know a lot more


00:55:47.844 --> 00:55:49.812
about their imaginary friends
than that, pal.


00:55:49.913 --> 00:55:52.108
You got yourself one hell
of a vivid imagination.


00:55:52.215 --> 00:55:53.614
1080, cancel that call.


00:55:53.717 --> 00:55:55.912
- 10-4.


00:55:56.019 --> 00:55:58.214
- They were just here!


00:55:58.321 --> 00:55:59.583
- Look, you know what?


00:55:59.689 --> 00:56:01.384
Next time, just don't call us.


00:56:01.491 --> 00:56:02.480
Let's go.


00:56:02.592 --> 00:56:05.584
Wasting my time, man.


00:56:18.074 --> 00:56:19.200
[knocking at door]


00:56:21.211 --> 00:56:22.872
- Yeah?


00:56:22.979 --> 00:56:24.970
- Who lives in the apartment
next to mine?


00:56:25.081 --> 00:56:26.981
- Why?


00:56:27.083 --> 00:56:28.516
- Because I just called
the cops on them,


00:56:28.618 --> 00:56:31.246
and they showed up,
and there was nobody there.


00:56:31.354 --> 00:56:34.949
So what the hell is going on?


00:56:37.427 --> 00:56:38.519
- You called the police on who?


00:56:38.628 --> 00:56:40.425
- On the guy in the apartment
next to mine.


00:56:40.530 --> 00:56:41.519
He's a cop.


00:56:42.932 --> 00:56:44.661
- Look, I don't know
what you're talking about.


00:56:44.768 --> 00:56:45.757
That apartment's been empty


00:56:45.869 --> 00:56:47.166
ever since I started
working here.


00:56:47.270 --> 00:56:49.602
517, right?


00:56:49.706 --> 00:56:51.037
- Yeah-no.


00:56:51.141 --> 00:56:53.666
There's-there's a girl.


00:56:53.777 --> 00:56:56.075
There's a kid and her mom,


00:56:56.179 --> 00:56:58.670
and the dad is abusing them
all day long.


00:56:58.782 --> 00:57:00.079
Everybody in the place
can hear it.


00:57:00.183 --> 00:57:01.275
- Yeah, not everyone.


00:57:01.384 --> 00:57:04.911
- I've-
I've seen them.


00:57:05.021 --> 00:57:07.148
Look, I've walked each and every
hall in this building.


00:57:07.257 --> 00:57:08.622
I know every tenant
that lives here.


00:57:08.725 --> 00:57:11.819
I've never seen a girl
or a family in 517.


00:57:11.928 --> 00:57:14.055
Just you and that guy in 512
live there.


00:57:16.900 --> 00:57:18.925
Now, let me sleep.


00:57:19.035 --> 00:57:20.024
[door slams]


00:57:20.136 --> 00:57:23.128
[locks clicking]


00:57:43.393 --> 00:57:46.385
[melancholy piano music]


00:57:46.496 --> 00:57:54.494
¶ ¶


00:58:09.919 --> 00:58:12.820
[muffled rock music]


00:58:12.922 --> 00:58:21.296
¶ ¶


00:58:21.397 --> 00:58:23.592
- What?


00:58:23.700 --> 00:58:24.724
- You're killing me.


00:58:24.834 --> 00:58:27.826
- Sorry.


00:58:32.442 --> 00:58:35.434
[girl crying]


00:58:51.995 --> 00:58:53.553
We still have two more chapters.


00:58:53.663 --> 00:58:55.187
- I got to go.


00:58:55.298 --> 00:58:56.458
- What?


00:58:56.566 --> 00:58:57.555
Why?


00:58:57.667 --> 00:59:00.693
Wait.


00:59:00.803 --> 00:59:02.771
[people chattering]


00:59:02.872 --> 00:59:04.100
Are you okay?


00:59:06.743 --> 00:59:07.903
- It was my fault.


00:59:08.011 --> 00:59:10.036
- What was?


00:59:10.146 --> 00:59:12.512
- Bobby went to jail
because of me.


00:59:12.615 --> 00:59:16.051
- What do you mean?


00:59:18.588 --> 00:59:20.647
We were at that bar
on Rivington.


00:59:22.525 --> 00:59:25.790
Some guy followed me
into the bathroom.


00:59:25.895 --> 00:59:28.090
He pushed me
up against the wall,


00:59:28.197 --> 00:59:30.791
and put his hand over my mouth.


00:59:30.900 --> 00:59:33.061
- What?


00:59:35.104 --> 00:59:40.167
- Next thing I know, Bobby,


00:59:40.276 --> 00:59:46.647
he hit him so hard that I heard
the bones in his face crack.


00:59:46.749 --> 00:59:50.014
And he didn't stop.


00:59:50.119 --> 00:59:52.986
The more I cried,
the more Bobby hit him.


00:59:53.089 --> 00:59:55.080
- Al, he killed someone.


00:59:57.894 --> 01:00:00.294
- I don't know what to do.


01:00:00.396 --> 01:00:01.795
I mean, he did all that time.


01:00:01.898 --> 01:00:03.490
- Maybe he'll hurt you some day.


01:00:04.534 --> 01:00:05.728
- It's-it's not him.


01:00:05.835 --> 01:00:08.929
It never was.


01:00:09.038 --> 01:00:12.064
He was only trying to help.


01:00:14.110 --> 01:00:18.444
- I just want you
to be careful, okay?


01:00:18.548 --> 01:00:19.572
- Yeah.


01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:24.610
[tool whirring]


01:00:34.063 --> 01:00:36.054
- [exhales hard]


01:00:42.705 --> 01:00:45.697
[footsteps pattering]


01:00:54.884 --> 01:00:57.876
[loud grinding]


01:01:03.693 --> 01:01:06.685
[panting]


01:01:15.905 --> 01:01:17.338
- What the hell's your problem,
man?


01:01:17.440 --> 01:01:18.907
- [heavy breathing]


01:01:36.159 --> 01:01:37.148
- You all right, bro?


01:01:38.828 --> 01:01:43.265
- Uh, I got blood coming out
of my ears.


01:01:43.366 --> 01:01:45.698
- How the hell did you
do that, man?


01:01:45.802 --> 01:01:46.791
- I don't know.


01:01:46.903 --> 01:01:48.393
- Go see a doctor.


01:01:48.504 --> 01:01:49.732
- I got to finish my shift, man.


01:01:49.839 --> 01:01:50.828
- Go see a doctor.


01:01:50.940 --> 01:01:52.498
Blood coming out of your ears
ain't normal.


01:01:52.608 --> 01:01:53.597
Are you sick or something?


01:01:53.710 --> 01:01:58.272
You doing okay?


01:01:58.381 --> 01:02:00.508
- How do you mean?


01:02:00.616 --> 01:02:02.982
- I'm not gonna pretend like
I know you,


01:02:03.086 --> 01:02:08.080
but you been falling apart
since you took this job.


01:02:08.191 --> 01:02:14.460
- Um, if I try to explain it,
it's not gonna sound right.


01:02:14.564 --> 01:02:17.431
- When I came out of recovery,
I started over too.


01:02:17.533 --> 01:02:19.467
I had a sponsor to talk to
when things got out of hand.


01:02:19.569 --> 01:02:20.968
You know what I'm saying?


01:02:21.070 --> 01:02:25.029
You need someone to talk to,
or you're gonna fall apart.


01:02:25.141 --> 01:02:26.130
Go home.


01:02:26.242 --> 01:02:29.336
I'll lock up.


01:02:29.445 --> 01:02:34.246
- All right.


01:02:34.350 --> 01:02:38.218
[horns honking]


01:02:38.321 --> 01:02:39.345
I'm leaving the city.


01:02:39.455 --> 01:02:40.444
I can't stay here.


01:02:40.556 --> 01:02:41.545
- Why?


01:02:41.657 --> 01:02:42.919
- I think whatever's-


01:02:43.025 --> 01:02:44.856
whatever happened to my mother
is happening to me.


01:02:44.961 --> 01:02:47.521
And l-I just-
I just got to make it stop.


01:02:47.630 --> 01:02:48.722
- What?


01:02:48.831 --> 01:02:51.994
What?


01:02:52.101 --> 01:02:55.366
- I'm hear-I'm hearing sounds,


01:02:55.471 --> 01:02:58.907
and I am seeing people
who aren't there.


01:03:00.977 --> 01:03:04.504
- Bobby,
your mother was sick.


01:03:04.614 --> 01:03:07.014
- She wasn't crazy.


01:03:07.116 --> 01:03:09.607
Something made her crazy.


01:03:09.719 --> 01:03:12.017
- Maybe you leaving


01:03:12.121 --> 01:03:15.579
did make her depressed.


01:03:18.427 --> 01:03:19.917
You deserted her,


01:03:20.029 --> 01:03:25.626
Iike you deserted a lot
of people in your life.


01:03:37.880 --> 01:03:38.869
- You got tables.


01:03:43.786 --> 01:03:45.549
- I got to go.


01:03:53.629 --> 01:03:56.462
[old-fashioned music]


01:03:56.566 --> 01:04:04.564
¶ ¶


01:04:15.618 --> 01:04:18.610
[girl whimpering]


01:04:27.496 --> 01:04:30.488
[gasps]


01:04:38.708 --> 01:04:41.700
[breathing heavily]


01:05:01.497 --> 01:05:04.489
[screaming]


01:05:21.817 --> 01:05:24.809
[knocking at door]


01:05:28.758 --> 01:05:29.747
- Open the door.


01:05:33.596 --> 01:05:34.858
Open the door, please!


01:05:34.964 --> 01:05:36.431
I know you're in there!


01:05:36.532 --> 01:05:39.228
[screeching]


01:05:39.335 --> 01:05:42.327
- [screams]


01:05:46.342 --> 01:05:49.334
[cries out]


01:05:59.755 --> 01:06:02.747
[grunts]


01:06:06.762 --> 01:06:09.754
- [screaming]


01:06:46.235 --> 01:06:49.227
- [panting]


01:07:07.923 --> 01:07:10.915
[crashing]


01:07:17.767 --> 01:07:19.257
- What do you want?


01:07:19.368 --> 01:07:22.633
- What do you want?


01:07:22.738 --> 01:07:23.727
[knocking at door]


01:07:23.839 --> 01:07:25.739
- Good morning, sir.
- Yeah.


01:07:27.576 --> 01:07:28.941
- Do you know a Joseph Wright?


01:07:29.045 --> 01:07:30.842
He lives down the hall from you.


01:07:30.946 --> 01:07:32.004
- I just moved in.


01:07:32.114 --> 01:07:33.672
- Heard anything
out of the ordinary?


01:07:33.783 --> 01:07:35.614
Seen anyone suspicious?


01:07:35.718 --> 01:07:38.653
- No.


01:07:38.754 --> 01:07:40.779
- The neighbors told us
you just got out of Rikers.


01:07:40.890 --> 01:07:43.484
Is that true?


01:07:43.592 --> 01:07:44.581
- What's this about?


01:07:44.693 --> 01:07:46.354
- Were you home all evening?


01:07:46.462 --> 01:07:47.759
- No, I was with a friend.


01:07:47.863 --> 01:07:49.728
- I may be back
with more questions.


01:07:55.738 --> 01:07:58.730
[door slams]


01:08:00.543 --> 01:08:03.341
- No, no.


01:08:07.950 --> 01:08:10.942
- You didn't see anything?


01:08:26.335 --> 01:08:28.530
- Rick, you want to give me
a hand with this?


01:08:30.806 --> 01:08:32.273
- Yo, Bobby!


01:08:35.744 --> 01:08:37.177
You're an hour late.


01:08:37.279 --> 01:08:40.146
- Sorry, man, there's something
going on in my building today.


01:08:40.249 --> 01:08:41.773
- We need to talk.


01:08:41.884 --> 01:08:43.511
- Yeah.


01:08:43.619 --> 01:08:46.315
- You come by the shop
last night?


01:08:46.422 --> 01:08:48.049
- No.


01:08:48.157 --> 01:08:49.146
- You sure you didn't come by


01:08:49.258 --> 01:08:50.247
the shop
last night after closing?


01:08:50.359 --> 01:08:51.621
- Yeah.


01:08:51.727 --> 01:08:53.456
- There was a 300 that came in
for a tire balance.


01:08:53.562 --> 01:08:55.223
You remember it?


01:08:55.331 --> 01:08:56.320
- It wasn't mine.


01:08:56.432 --> 01:08:58.332
I didn't do a balance yesterday.


01:08:58.434 --> 01:08:59.799
- It's gone.


01:08:59.902 --> 01:09:01.392
I came in this morning,
it was off the lot.


01:09:01.504 --> 01:09:03.438
I called up the owner,
she hasn't picked it up yet.


01:09:06.242 --> 01:09:08.972
- You got something you want
to ask me, man?


01:09:11.080 --> 01:09:13.844
- Look, my other guys have been
with me for years, Bobby.


01:09:13.949 --> 01:09:15.280
All I got on you
is your history.


01:09:15.384 --> 01:09:18.717
But I have a situation
with no other answer.


01:09:18.821 --> 01:09:20.288
If that 300 gets returned
in the next hour,


01:09:20.389 --> 01:09:21.378
I won't call the cops.


01:09:21.490 --> 01:09:22.479
- I don't have the car, man.


01:09:22.591 --> 01:09:24.684
- No, I'm trying to give you
the benefit of the doubt here.


01:09:24.793 --> 01:09:26.886
- Call the cops, man.


01:09:26.996 --> 01:09:28.190
I don't have the car.


01:09:28.297 --> 01:09:31.596
- I can't keep you on until
that 300 turns up.


01:09:31.700 --> 01:09:32.724
- Yeah.


01:09:32.835 --> 01:09:35.827
All right.


01:09:54.390 --> 01:09:57.382
[wind rushing]


01:10:06.302 --> 01:10:09.294
[crashing]


01:10:10.606 --> 01:10:13.598
- Hello?


01:10:13.709 --> 01:10:15.939
[footsteps running]


01:10:16.045 --> 01:10:17.637
Hello?


01:10:25.588 --> 01:10:28.580
[girl whimpering]


01:10:58.187 --> 01:11:00.121
- Yo, what's this?


01:11:00.222 --> 01:11:02.053
How the hell did this happen?


01:11:02.157 --> 01:11:03.886
Damn, man!


01:11:03.993 --> 01:11:05.585
Watch the shop.


01:11:08.564 --> 01:11:11.556
- [gasping]


01:11:24.046 --> 01:11:26.014
[distant whispering]


01:11:35.190 --> 01:11:40.355
[breathing heavily]


01:11:40.462 --> 01:11:43.454
[door creaking]


01:12:12.895 --> 01:12:15.887
[screaming]


01:12:22.338 --> 01:12:24.169
- Are you okay?


01:12:40.055 --> 01:12:41.955
- Alyssa Foldes?
Alyssa Foldes.


01:12:42.057 --> 01:12:43.456
Anybody-


01:12:43.559 --> 01:12:48.690
nobody knows her?


01:12:48.797 --> 01:12:49.923
Alyssa Foldes?


01:12:50.032 --> 01:12:52.091
You know Alyssa?


01:12:52.201 --> 01:12:54.601
It's really important
that I talk to her.


01:12:54.703 --> 01:12:56.227
- Sorry.


01:12:56.338 --> 01:12:57.430
I don't know where she is.


01:12:59.074 --> 01:13:00.268
- Come on.


01:13:00.376 --> 01:13:02.469
You got to help me out.


01:13:05.381 --> 01:13:06.871
- She put a lot of trust in you.


01:13:06.982 --> 01:13:09.314
And you're going to end up
hurting her again.


01:13:09.418 --> 01:13:11.113
She can't deal with that
in her life right now.


01:13:11.220 --> 01:13:12.380
- You don't know
what's going on.


01:13:12.488 --> 01:13:13.921
- I know Alyssa
never showed up tonight.


01:13:14.022 --> 01:13:15.011
I know she didn't turn in
her final.


01:13:15.124 --> 01:13:16.182
And I know she's only been
acting like this


01:13:16.291 --> 01:13:17.280
since you showed up.


01:13:17.393 --> 01:13:19.827
Just leave her alone.


01:13:19.928 --> 01:13:22.055
She knows about the other girl.


01:13:22.164 --> 01:13:24.394
- What other girl?


01:13:24.500 --> 01:13:26.832
- The woman at your apartment.


01:13:27.703 --> 01:13:28.863
- Did-did Alyssa talk to her?


01:13:28.971 --> 01:13:30.871
- Don't know.


01:13:30.973 --> 01:13:33.032
- Just have her call me.


01:13:38.747 --> 01:13:39.736
[knocking at door]


01:13:39.848 --> 01:13:42.112
- Bobby, you there?


01:13:42.217 --> 01:13:44.879
It's Hector.


01:13:44.987 --> 01:13:46.852
The city towed
the wrong car, man.


01:13:46.955 --> 01:13:49.185
I'm sorry I doubted you.


01:13:49.291 --> 01:13:52.488
You still have your job
if you want it, man.


01:13:52.594 --> 01:13:53.583
[knocking at door]


01:13:53.695 --> 01:13:56.687
Bobby!


01:14:31.733 --> 01:14:32.722
Are you all right, kid?


01:14:54.289 --> 01:14:56.257
Hello?


01:14:56.358 --> 01:14:58.588
Little girl?


01:14:58.694 --> 01:15:02.095
You all right?


01:15:03.832 --> 01:15:07.063
Hello?


01:15:07.169 --> 01:15:08.602
Where are you?


01:15:13.575 --> 01:15:17.136
Hello?


01:15:17.246 --> 01:15:20.238
Little girl?


01:15:42.371 --> 01:15:45.363
[gasps]


01:16:03.425 --> 01:16:05.052
Help!


01:16:05.160 --> 01:16:06.650
Help!


01:16:06.762 --> 01:16:07.751
Anybody?


01:16:07.863 --> 01:16:13.233
Help!


01:16:13.335 --> 01:16:16.566
[phone beeping]


01:16:16.672 --> 01:16:19.664
Damn it!


01:16:30.886 --> 01:16:33.878
[panting]


01:16:46.668 --> 01:16:49.660
[choking]


01:16:52.674 --> 01:16:53.663
[phone ringing]


01:16:53.775 --> 01:16:54.969
- Hello?


01:16:55.077 --> 01:16:56.704
- Mr. Reynolds, do you know
what day it is today?


01:16:56.812 --> 01:16:57.801
- No.
What?


01:16:57.913 --> 01:16:59.505
- It's your weekly check-in.


01:17:01.450 --> 01:17:03.577
Appointments with your PO
are not optional.


01:17:03.685 --> 01:17:05.346
I thought we understood
each other.


01:17:05.454 --> 01:17:06.443
- Yeah.


01:17:06.555 --> 01:17:07.647
Sorry.


01:17:07.756 --> 01:17:10.884
- Is there something
I should know?


01:17:14.429 --> 01:17:15.589
Mr. Reynolds?


01:17:15.697 --> 01:17:17.358
- I can't talk right now.


01:17:17.466 --> 01:17:19.457
- Look, let me give this to you
in vivid detail.


01:17:19.568 --> 01:17:21.661
You speed your way


01:17:21.770 --> 01:17:23.067
into the parole office
right now,


01:17:23.171 --> 01:17:25.765
or you illegally violate,
and we come looking for you.


01:17:25.874 --> 01:17:27.637
You get me?


01:17:31.413 --> 01:17:32.402
Mr. Reynolds?


01:18:14.356 --> 01:18:16.824
- Help-help me!


01:18:16.925 --> 01:18:18.825
I know you're in there!
Please!


01:18:18.927 --> 01:18:21.589
Please open the door!


01:18:38.380 --> 01:18:41.372
[strange scraping noises]


01:19:02.003 --> 01:19:04.995
[people chattering]


01:19:08.276 --> 01:19:09.265
- Bobby?


01:19:09.377 --> 01:19:11.868
Bobby, can you hear me?


01:19:11.980 --> 01:19:13.106
Look, um, those-


01:19:13.215 --> 01:19:15.149
those noises that you heard,
I think-


01:19:15.250 --> 01:19:16.478
I think I may be
hearing them too.


01:19:16.585 --> 01:19:18.018
I don't understand
what's happening.


01:19:18.120 --> 01:19:19.747
You were trying to tell me
something,


01:19:19.855 --> 01:19:21.220
and I didn't listen,
and I'm sorry.


01:19:21.323 --> 01:19:23.052
And I'm going to come
and find you, okay?


01:19:45.313 --> 01:19:47.304
[knocking at door]


01:19:47.415 --> 01:19:48.404
- Open the door!


01:19:59.194 --> 01:20:00.183
- Bobby?


01:20:20.582 --> 01:20:23.745
- Think I don't know
you're in there?


01:20:23.852 --> 01:20:26.377
- I don't want trouble.


01:20:26.488 --> 01:20:28.319
- You've been watching me.
I see you in the window.


01:20:28.423 --> 01:20:29.412
What are you looking at?


01:20:31.193 --> 01:20:33.889
Something happened
on that floor.


01:20:39.801 --> 01:20:41.769
You know something, don't you?


01:20:41.870 --> 01:20:45.271
- There was this family
living there.


01:20:45.373 --> 01:20:47.841
One night,


01:20:47.943 --> 01:20:49.501
the mother, she kept screaming.


01:20:49.611 --> 01:20:51.602
- No.


01:20:51.713 --> 01:20:54.876
Don't!


01:20:54.983 --> 01:20:57.577
- But nobody helped her.


01:20:59.521 --> 01:21:00.681
- It doesn't make sense.


01:21:00.789 --> 01:21:02.586
You could-you could have
just called the cops.


01:21:02.691 --> 01:21:04.886
- A lot of terrible things
happen in this city every day.


01:21:04.993 --> 01:21:08.190
- Either we assumed someone
would call the police,


01:21:08.296 --> 01:21:11.231
or we were afraid to,
or worse.


01:21:11.333 --> 01:21:12.732
[woman screaming]


01:21:12.834 --> 01:21:16.463
Some of us just didn't care.


01:21:16.571 --> 01:21:19.404
The next morning,
they were all dead.


01:21:25.814 --> 01:21:28.715
[gunshot]


01:21:28.817 --> 01:21:31.809
- It's your fault.


01:21:35.891 --> 01:21:37.950
You could have done something.


01:21:38.059 --> 01:21:39.048
You let them die.


01:21:39.160 --> 01:21:41.219
Any one of you,
my mother included,


01:21:41.329 --> 01:21:42.318
could have saved them.


01:21:42.430 --> 01:21:44.796
You realize that?


01:21:48.670 --> 01:21:52.003
[locks clicking]


01:21:52.107 --> 01:21:54.041
Hey, hey, hey!
Wait!


01:21:54.142 --> 01:21:56.042
- I'm sorry.
I can't help you.


01:21:56.144 --> 01:21:59.136
- Why-why won't they stop?


01:22:04.352 --> 01:22:05.876
[knocking at door]


01:22:05.987 --> 01:22:09.218
- Hello, Miss?


01:22:09.324 --> 01:22:10.313
Is he in there?


01:22:10.425 --> 01:22:12.086
I really need to find him.


01:22:12.193 --> 01:22:14.184
[knocking at door]


01:22:23.638 --> 01:22:27.301
Anyone home?


01:22:33.315 --> 01:22:37.649
Sorry, l-


01:22:37.752 --> 01:22:40.380
the woman who walked
in here, do you...


01:22:42.390 --> 01:22:43.482
[door slams]


01:22:43.591 --> 01:22:46.583
[locks click]


01:23:01.042 --> 01:23:04.034
[locks clicking]


01:23:25.133 --> 01:23:26.623
[gasps]


01:23:26.735 --> 01:23:27.759
[door slams]


01:23:27.869 --> 01:23:29.996
[panting]


01:23:30.105 --> 01:23:33.097
[screaming]


01:23:49.324 --> 01:23:52.452
[moaning]


01:23:52.560 --> 01:23:55.552
[screams]


01:24:04.272 --> 01:24:07.264
[coughing]


01:24:10.578 --> 01:24:13.570
[screams]


01:24:20.889 --> 01:24:23.881
[whimpering]


01:24:29.030 --> 01:24:32.022
[Alyssa crying]


01:24:42.110 --> 01:24:45.102
[crying]


01:24:54.122 --> 01:24:55.146
- Oh, my God!


01:24:55.256 --> 01:24:56.245
Alyssa?


01:24:56.357 --> 01:24:58.689
Alyssa!


01:24:58.793 --> 01:24:59.817
I'm so sorry.


01:24:59.928 --> 01:25:01.953
I'm so sorry.


01:25:02.063 --> 01:25:03.724
Oh, my God.


01:25:03.832 --> 01:25:04.821
What did they do to you?


01:25:07.235 --> 01:25:10.363
[phone trilling]


01:25:10.472 --> 01:25:11.996
Oh, God.


01:25:12.107 --> 01:25:14.098
Oh, God.


01:25:14.209 --> 01:25:15.198
Please.


01:25:15.310 --> 01:25:17.210
- 91 1.
What is your emergency?


01:25:17.312 --> 01:25:18.802
I-I need an ambulance.


01:25:18.913 --> 01:25:20.881
Please.


01:25:20.982 --> 01:25:22.677
- What is your current location?


01:25:22.784 --> 01:25:26.185
[high-pitched discordant
piano music]


01:25:26.287 --> 01:25:27.879
Sir?


01:25:27.989 --> 01:25:28.978
Can you hear me?


01:25:29.090 --> 01:25:30.887
¶ ¶


01:25:30.992 --> 01:25:31.981
Sir?


01:25:33.428 --> 01:25:35.328
- You're doing real good, honey.


01:25:35.430 --> 01:25:37.330
Everything's going to be okay.


01:25:37.432 --> 01:25:41.129
But I want you to be strong
for mommy.


01:25:41.236 --> 01:25:42.999
You got me?


01:25:43.104 --> 01:25:44.662
Right.
Let me see that pretty smile.


01:25:44.772 --> 01:25:47.764
There.


01:25:56.951 --> 01:25:59.044
- Hey, what are you doing?


01:26:01.389 --> 01:26:05.587
- Please don't do this.


01:26:05.693 --> 01:26:10.596
- Don't do what?


01:26:17.305 --> 01:26:18.738
- We're leaving.


01:26:23.378 --> 01:26:24.868
- Why are you leaving?


01:26:27.081 --> 01:26:28.070
- You know why.


01:26:28.183 --> 01:26:29.172
- But you...
- Don't!


01:26:29.284 --> 01:26:30.979
- You can't leave.
Whoa, whoa.


01:26:31.085 --> 01:26:32.074
What?
Don't what?


01:26:32.187 --> 01:26:33.176
What?


01:26:33.288 --> 01:26:34.346
[gasps]


01:26:34.455 --> 01:26:35.683
Shh, it's okay.


01:26:35.790 --> 01:26:39.191
It's okay.


01:26:39.294 --> 01:26:40.784
- Where are you?


01:26:40.895 --> 01:26:45.992
- Here, here, here,
here, here, here.


01:26:46.100 --> 01:26:47.089
- [crying]


01:26:47.202 --> 01:26:48.430
- Listen, listen.


01:26:50.138 --> 01:26:51.662
- You just close your eyes


01:26:51.773 --> 01:26:54.537
and go to that special place
like always.


01:26:54.642 --> 01:26:56.007
Nothing else will matter.


01:26:56.110 --> 01:26:57.099
- Carly, are you okay?


01:26:57.212 --> 01:26:58.270
Why are you crying?
What-


01:26:58.379 --> 01:26:59.710
- No.


01:26:59.814 --> 01:27:02.874
- l-I really don't understand
what's happening here.


01:27:02.984 --> 01:27:03.973
What-what-


01:27:06.254 --> 01:27:07.482
Why do you want to leave me?


01:27:07.589 --> 01:27:08.578
[crying]


01:27:08.690 --> 01:27:09.679
- Why?
- Hmm?


01:27:09.791 --> 01:27:11.986
- Look at me.


01:27:12.093 --> 01:27:14.152
You did-
you did this to me.


01:27:14.262 --> 01:27:16.753
- I didn't do that.


01:27:16.864 --> 01:27:18.195
Who the hell did that to you?


01:27:18.299 --> 01:27:19.288
- [crying]


01:27:19.400 --> 01:27:21.334
Go!
Run, baby, run!


01:27:21.436 --> 01:27:22.425
Look at me!


01:27:22.537 --> 01:27:23.765
Just let Carly go, please.


01:27:23.871 --> 01:27:26.237
- Uh, Carly...


01:27:26.341 --> 01:27:27.706
- Do what you have to do to me!


01:27:27.809 --> 01:27:29.037
- Carly.


01:27:29.143 --> 01:27:31.611
I don't understand
what's happening here.


01:27:31.713 --> 01:27:34.876
- Walter.


01:27:38.219 --> 01:27:39.777
- It's fricking making me-


01:27:39.887 --> 01:27:40.876
It makes me so mad!


01:27:40.989 --> 01:27:42.183
- [crying]


01:27:42.290 --> 01:27:44.087
- It's making me lose
my freakin' mind, you know.


01:27:44.192 --> 01:27:46.057
[breathing heavily]


01:27:46.160 --> 01:27:49.789
- Why won't you just let us go,
please?


01:27:49.897 --> 01:27:50.886
Please.


01:27:50.999 --> 01:27:52.466
- Baby.


01:27:52.567 --> 01:27:53.829
I love you so much.


01:27:56.638 --> 01:27:59.129
Just say it for me once okay?


01:27:59.240 --> 01:28:00.468
Just tell me that you love me.


01:28:00.575 --> 01:28:02.372
Just once.
Just say it.


01:28:02.477 --> 01:28:03.466
Just say that you-


01:28:03.578 --> 01:28:04.567
- No, no!


01:28:04.679 --> 01:28:06.544
Somebody help us!


01:28:06.648 --> 01:28:07.740
Please, someone help us!


01:28:07.849 --> 01:28:09.749
Open this door!
Come on.


01:28:09.851 --> 01:28:13.753
Please.


01:28:13.855 --> 01:28:17.154
No, don't, please.


01:28:17.258 --> 01:28:22.787
No, no.


01:28:22.897 --> 01:28:24.159
[scraping noises]


01:28:24.265 --> 01:28:25.254
Please, somebody help us!


01:28:25.366 --> 01:28:26.492
Come on and help me!


01:28:26.601 --> 01:28:28.159
Open the door!


01:28:28.269 --> 01:28:29.463
Somebody help us, please!


01:28:29.570 --> 01:28:30.935
No, Walter, no!


01:28:31.039 --> 01:28:32.768
No!


01:28:32.874 --> 01:28:34.239
No!


01:28:38.246 --> 01:28:40.111
- [crying]


01:28:40.214 --> 01:28:43.206
- [panting]


01:28:45.853 --> 01:28:52.588
- [whimpering]


01:28:52.694 --> 01:28:55.686
- [crying]


01:29:04.372 --> 01:29:07.364
- [crying]


01:29:14.716 --> 01:29:16.877
- Walter, no!


01:29:16.984 --> 01:29:19.714
- Stop!


01:29:21.956 --> 01:29:22.945
You got to stop.


01:29:27.829 --> 01:29:30.161
- You mind your own business.


01:29:32.633 --> 01:29:35.727
Agh!


01:29:35.837 --> 01:29:41.207
- [screams]


01:29:41.309 --> 01:29:44.870
- Agh!


01:29:44.979 --> 01:29:47.573
[wet thudding]


01:29:47.682 --> 01:29:49.479
- No!


01:29:49.584 --> 01:29:52.417
- [screaming]


01:30:03.798 --> 01:30:06.790
- [panting]


01:30:08.102 --> 01:30:11.094
- [screaming]


01:30:14.976 --> 01:30:17.968
- [coughing]


01:31:05.726 --> 01:31:08.718
- [sighs]


01:31:17.672 --> 01:31:20.664
- [crying]


01:31:45.566 --> 01:31:47.534
- Alyssa!


01:31:47.635 --> 01:31:49.899
- [whimpering]


01:31:50.004 --> 01:31:51.699
- Alyssa?


01:31:51.806 --> 01:31:54.798
- [crying]


01:32:01.282 --> 01:32:03.614
- Oh, it's okay.


01:32:03.718 --> 01:32:06.710
It's okay.


01:32:10.691 --> 01:32:13.683
[sirens wailing]


01:32:57.605 --> 01:33:00.597
[high-pitched discordant
piano music]


01:33:00.708 --> 01:33:08.706
¶ ¶

